{"sections":[{"slug":"曲线的模空间","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"曲线的模空间"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">曲线的模空间</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“曲线的模空间”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">曲线的模空间是</span> $\\Sigma$ <span lang=\"zh\">上复结构</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">在实</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形上等同于近复结构</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的模空间关于</span> $\\Sigma$ <span lang=\"zh\">的保定向微分自同胚群的商</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">粗模空间</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义模函子</span> $\\mathcal M_{g,n}\\colon \\mathsf {Sch}_\\mathbb{C} \\to \\mathsf {Set}$,\n$$\r\n\\mathcal M_{g,n}(S) := \\{(\\pi\\colon C\\to S,p_1,\\cdots,p_n\\colon S\\to C)\\}/{\\simeq},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\pi\\colon C\\to S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的亏格</span> $g$ <span lang=\"zh\">光滑曲线</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">曲线的模空间是指</span> $\\mathcal M_{g,n}$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的粗模空间</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线的模叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模叠</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Hitchin联络","text":"Hitchin <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}